<strong>Stack<\/strong><\/h3><p>Idiom on idiom.<br\/>Author your own unique fragrances.<\/p><h3><\/h3><h3><strong>Solo<\/strong><\/h3><p>Idiom. Singular. Bare.<\/p>","size":100,"text_position":"left","spacing_bottom":12}},"button_WLDtNe":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_text":"shop now","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/all","button_color":"btn--black","button_style":"btn--outline","button_size":"btn--small","video_link":"","text_position":"left","spacing_bottom":12}}},"block_order":["heading_bFUbdE","text_DEbVYc","button_WLDtNe"],"name":"Image with text","settings":{"show_accordion_divider":true,"increase_border_radius":false,"section_height":"six-fifty-height","enable_mobile_height":true,"mobile_height":"three-fifty-height-mobile","layout":"inline","image_location":"right","image_width":"wide","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/12.png","block_bg_color":"","text_color":"text-dark","bg_color":"#e9ebca","gradient":"","section_width":"wrapper--full-padded","add_gutter":true,"padding_top":60,"padding_bottom":60}},"section_image_with_text_MRLHwq":{"type":"section-image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_K7pthw":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"<p><strong>Elevated Single-minded fragrances<\/strong><\/p>","size":120,"text_position":"left","heading_highlight_type":"underline-hand-drawn","highlight_color":"#000000","highlight_text_color":"","spacing_bottom":12}},"text_Fwn8Kf":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Capturing the essence of a note, material, or idea with depth, clarity, and a f**k-me twist.<\/p><p><\/p><p><br\/>Made with intent from nature and chemistry.<\/p><p><\/p><p><br\/>Focused and true. Perfect for layering.<\/p>","size":100,"text_position":"left","spacing_bottom":12}}},"block_order":["heading_K7pthw","text_Fwn8Kf"],"name":"Image with text","settings":{"show_accordion_divider":true,"increase_border_radius":false,"section_height":"six-fifty-height","enable_mobile_height":true,"mobile_height":"three-fifty-height-mobile","layout":"inline","image_location":"left","image_width":"wide","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/134567890.gif","block_bg_color":"","text_color":"text-dark","bg_color":"","gradient":"","section_width":"wrapper","add_gutter":true,"padding_top":60,"padding_bottom":60}},"section_multicolumn_hAcCkz":{"type":"section-multicolumn","blocks":{"text_jagbk4":{"type":"text","settings":{"column_width":25,"subheading":"fragrance with","title":"full bodied soul","heading_size":140,"text":"<p>Layering fragrance designed to be as emotionally intelligent as they are efficacious.<\/p>","text_size":100,"button_text":"","button_link":"","button_color":"btn--black","button_style":"btn--solid","button_size":"btn--medium","bg_color":"","text_color":"text-dark"}},"image_hizJEL":{"type":"image","settings":{"column_width":34,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Heading.png","aspect_ratio_desktop":1.3,"aspect_ratio_mobile":1,"title":"Fragrance with Function.","heading_size":160,"text":"<p>Scent isn’t surface. It’s sensory, emotional, instinctive. Our fragrances aren’t just something you wear — they’re something you feel. Designed to shift your mood, spark memory, and let you show up in the world exactly how you feel that day. No fluff, no filler — just fragrance that makes you feel something.<\/p>","text_size":100,"button_text":"","button_link":"","button_color":"btn--black","button_style":"btn--solid","button_size":"btn--medium"}},"image_Hz66mQ":{"type":"image","settings":{"column_width":34,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/5553b0dea19b5a0733f74f2bc770897c.jpg","aspect_ratio_desktop":1.3,"aspect_ratio_mobile":1,"title":"Pure Blends. Full Impact.","heading_size":160,"text":"<p>We don’t mess with watered-down formulations. Each fragrance is built from high-quality, full-bodied ingredients - nothing diluted, nothing decorative. Crafted with world-class perfumers, every blend is made to be layered, worn solo, or dialled up. This is clean, uncompromising scent that actually performs.<\/p>","text_size":100,"button_text":"","button_link":"","button_color":"btn--black","button_style":"btn--solid","button_size":"btn--medium"}},"image_L8B8gt":{"type":"image","settings":{"column_width":34,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Screenshot_2025-07-17_at_10.47.38.png","aspect_ratio_desktop":1.3,"aspect_ratio_mobile":1,"title":"Serious Scents. Surreal Experience.","heading_size":160,"text":"<p>We take fragrance seriously — but not ourselves. Idiom brings a fresh energy to an industry full of gatekeeping and gloss. Think sharp design, irreverent tone, and a little bit of chaos. We’re here to shift the mood, mess with the rulebook, and make scent fun again.<\/p>","text_size":100,"button_text":"","button_link":"","button_color":"btn--black","button_style":"btn--solid","button_size":"btn--medium"}},"image_Hezk3A":{"type":"image","settings":{"column_width":34,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/hgtdf.png","aspect_ratio_desktop":1.3,"aspect_ratio_mobile":1,"title":"Made to Layer. Build to Express.","heading_size":160,"text":"<p>Scent is self-expression — and no one smells like you. Our collection is designed to mix, clash, and evolve with your mood. Whether you want to go deep, fresh, bright or bold, Idiom gives you the tools to layer your way to something entirely your own.<\/p>","text_size":100,"button_text":"","button_link":"","button_color":"btn--black","button_style":"btn--solid","button_size":"btn--medium"}}},"block_order":["text_jagbk4","image_hizJEL","image_Hz66mQ","image_L8B8gt","image_Hezk3A"],"disabled":true,"name":"Multi column","settings":{"title":"","heading_size":120,"text":"","text_size":100,"align_heading":"text-left","align_text":"text-left","bg_color":"","gradient":"","text_color":"text-dark","layout_mobile":"carousel","width":"wrapper--full-padded","padding_top":60,"padding_bottom":60}},"section_image_with_text_AVE3cc":{"type":"section-image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_DTGDKP":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"<p>Solo. Layer. Customise.<\/p>","size":120,"text_position":"left","heading_highlight_type":"underline-hand-drawn","highlight_color":"#000000","highlight_text_color":"","spacing_bottom":12}},"text_BU7L4V":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Solo. Layer. Remix.<\/p><p><\/p><p>Wear Saffron Haze solo for golden warmth, or let it amplify a citrus scent with opulent depth. Layer Vetiver Ace under florals for grounding calm, or let Bergamot Hi Fi brighten any composition.<\/p><p><\/p><p>Layer like no one else™<\/p>","size":100,"text_position":"left","spacing_bottom":12}}},"block_order":["heading_DTGDKP","text_BU7L4V"],"disabled":true,"name":"Image with text","settings":{"show_accordion_divider":true,"increase_border_radius":false,"section_height":"six-fifty-height","enable_mobile_height":false,"mobile_height":"four-fifty-height-mobile","layout":"inline","image_location":"left","image_width":"wide","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/11.png","block_bg_color":"","text_color":"text-dark","bg_color":"","gradient":"","section_width":"wrapper--full-padded","add_gutter":true,"padding_top":60,"padding_bottom":60}},"section_text_T6Apqa":{"type":"section-text","blocks":{"subheading_8mnNUM":{"type":"subheading","disabled":true,"settings":{"text":"<p>Subheading<\/p>","size":100,"margin_bottom":16}},"heading_7PehQ6":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"<p><strong>Made in London.<\/strong><\/p>","size":100,"heading_highlight_type":"underline-hand-drawn","highlight_color":"#000","highlight_text_color":""}},"text_LbhBqe":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Idiom started as an argument —<\/p><p>a fragrance insider, a skincare obsessive,<\/p><p>and an opinionated Gen Z’er (is there any other kind?)<\/p>","size":100}},"button_FnACfL":{"type":"button","disabled":true,"settings":{"button_text":"Read More","button_link":"","button_color":"btn--black","button_style":"btn--solid","button_size":"btn--medium"}}},"block_order":["subheading_8mnNUM","heading_7PehQ6","text_LbhBqe","button_FnACfL"],"disabled":true,"name":"Text","settings":{"text_position":"center","bg_c